      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Advise your reps to acknowledge the competitor's profile briefly, then immediately pivot to CardioZen's unique value proposition. Focus on superior efficacy, patient benefit, or specific, manageable side effects that are outweighed by the drug's advantages. Have data-backed responses ready that highlight long-term positive patient outcomes with CardioZen. This shifts the focus from a liability to a strategic selling point.",
